 begin="00:09.452" end="00:09.642">you </span><span begin="00:09.642" end="00:10.503">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.329" end="00:15.506"><span begin="00:12.329" end="00:12.553">'Cause </span><span begin="00:12.553" end="00:12.780">once </span><span begin="00:12.780" end="00:13.250">upon </span><span begin="00:13.250" end="00:13.450">a </span><span begin="00:13.450" end="00:13.713">time </span><span begin="00:13.713" end="00:13.912">you </span><span begin="00:13.912" end="00:14.093">were </span><span begin="00:14.093" end="00:14.278">my </span><span begin="00:14.278" end="00:15.506">everything</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.901" end="00:18.728"><span begin="00:15.901" end="00:16.081">It's </span><span begin="00:16.081" end="00:16.237">clear </span><span begin="00:16.237" end="00:16.409">to </span><span begin="00:16.409" end="00:16.634">see </span><span begin="00:16.634" end="00:16.820">that </span><span begin="00:16.820" end="00:17.176">time </span><span begin="00:17.176" end="00:17.416">hasn't </span><span begin="00:17.416" end="00:17.860">changed </span><span begin="00:17.860" end="00:18.241">a </span><span begin="00:18.241" end="00:18.728">thing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.742" end="00:24.002"><span begin="00:19.742" end="00:19.964">It's </span><span begin="00:19.964" end="00:20.332">buried </span><span begin="00:20.332" end="00:20.685">deep </span><span begin="00:20.685" end="00:20.897">inside </span><span begin="00:20.897" end="00:21.149">me </span><span begin="00:21.149" end="00:21.375">but </span><span begin="00:21.375" end="00:21.574">I </span><span begin="00:21.574" end="00:21.780">feel </span><span begin="00:21.780" end="00:21.973">there's </span><span begin="00:21.973" end="00:22.433">something </span><span begin="00:22.433" end="00:22.663">you </span><span begin="00:22.663" end="00:22.989">should </span><span begin="00:22.989" end="00:24.002">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.321" end="00:28.123"><span begin="00:26.321" end="00:26.437">I </span><span begin="00:26.437" end="00:26.594">will </span><span begin="00:26.594" end="00:27.101">never </span><span begin="00:27.101" end="00:27.657">forget </span><span begin="00:27.657" end="00:28.123">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.396" end="00:31.980"><span begin="00:29.396" end="00:29.716">You'll </span><span begin="00:29.716" end="00:30.404">always </span><span begin="00:30.404" end="00:30.620">be </span><span begin="00:30.620" end="00:30.903">by </span><span begin="00:30.903" end="00:31.357">my </span><span begin="00:31.357" end="00:31.980">side</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.718" end="00:34.730"><span begin="00:32.718" end="00:32.904">From </span><span begin="00:32.904" end="00:33.074">the </span><span begin="00:33.074" end="00:33.472">day </span><span begin="00:33.472" end="00:33.655">that </span><span begin="00:33.655" end="00:33.862">I </span><span begin="00:33.862" end="00:34.210">met </span><span begin="00:34.210" end="00:34.730">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.393" end="00:38.467"><span begin="00:35.393" end="00:35.598">I </span><span begin="00:35.598" end="00:35.877">knew </span><span begin="00:35.877" end="00:36.132">that </span><span begin="00:36.132" end="00:36.321">I </span><span begin="00:36.321" end="00:36.493">would </span><span begin="00:36.493" end="00:36.691">love </span><span begin="00:36.691" end="00:36.876">you </span><span begin="00:36.876" end="00:37.086">'til </span><span begin="00:37.086" end="00:37.263">the </span><span begin="00:37.263" end="00:37.522">day </span><span begin="00:37.522" end="00:37.880">I </span><span begin="00:37.880" end="00:38.467">die</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.690" end="00:41.801"><span begin="00:38.690" end="00:38.886">And </span><span begin="00:38.886" end="00:39.074">I </span><span begin="00:39.074" end="00:39.359">will </span><span begin="00:39.359" end="00:40.465">never </span><span begin="00:40.465" end="00:40.792">want </